  <h4 class="section-subtitle">ABOUT AZILEHUB ACADEMY</h4>

  <h1 class="about-title">
    Practical knowledge. Real engineering. Continuous learning.
  </h1>

  <p>
    <strong>Azilehub Academy</strong> is an independent technology
    learning and knowledge-sharing platform dedicated to making
    modern infrastructure and engineering technologies easier
    to understand and implement.
  </p>

  <p>
    We bridge the gap between theory and practice through
    structured tutorials, hands-on labs, architecture guides,
    implementation examples, and troubleshooting resources.
  </p>

  <h2>Our Mission</h2>
  <p>
    To make practical technology knowledge accessible to learners,
    system administrators, DevOps engineers, cloud practitioners,
    and infrastructure professionals through clear explanations
    and hands-on learning resources.
  </p>

  <h2>What We Cover</h2>
  <p>
    Our learning resources explore key areas of modern technology
    and infrastructure engineering:
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Linux & System Administration:</strong>
      Linux fundamentals, networking, shell scripting, and system services.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>DevOps & Automation:</strong>
      Git, Docker, CI/CD, Ansible, and Terraform.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Kubernetes & Cloud:</strong>
      Kubernetes, OpenShift, container orchestration, cloud infrastructure,
      and GitOps.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Monitoring & Observability:</strong>
      Prometheus, Grafana, metrics, logging, and alerting.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>HPC & GPU Computing:</strong>
      High-performance computing, Slurm, PBS Pro, GPU infrastructure,
