  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>Understand concepts, architecture, and core components.</li>
    <li>Explore installation and configuration procedures.</li>
    <li>Practice commands, scripts, and real-world examples.</li>
    <li>Build and validate working implementations.</li>
    <li>Learn troubleshooting techniques and operational practices.</li>
  </ul>

